! Astro Headless Plugin

This plugin provides a Headless CMS integration for Astro.

!! Usage

1. Add the `<$astro-build-button/>` widget to your wiki.
2. Tag your blog posts with `Public`.
3. Click the button to export data and build your Astro site.

!! Build Log

Check [[$:/plugins/byper/astro-headless/log]] for the latest build status.
